  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Sector Deepening Tza phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Financial Sector Deepening Tza phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Financial Sector Deepening Trust (FSDT) st&#xf6;ds av flera givare och     bedriver sin verksamhet i Tanzania. Den skapades 2004 f&#xf6;r att         facilitera utvecklingen av den finansiella sektorn och &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ngen till finansiella tj&#xe4;nster i Tanzania. Sida har tillsammans med DfID,  Danmark, Nederl&#xe4;nderna, Cida and Tanzanias regering (genom en sk IDA  kredit fr&#xe5;n V&#xe4;rldsbanken) givit finansiellt st&#xf6;d till f&#xf6;rsta fasen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Financial Sector Deepening Trust (FSDT) is a multi donor facility and was created to facilitate the development of the financial sector and to increase access of financial services in Tanzania. Sida has    together with DfID, Denmark, the Netherlands, Cida and the Government of Tanzania (GoT) supported the FSDT phase 1 since 2005 with just     over 50 MUSD.This is phase 2.</narrative>
  </description>
